From f1d5ef1bc46d30d7474d4ce7a41aaa22404831d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Harness Workbench <codex-harness-workbench@localhost>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 15:59:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: reject stale same-provider config writes via CAS

Fold the K1 probe into daemon-config-store tests: keep key-merged
provider adds and optional revisions, and reject a stale
expectedRevision instead of silently replacing another client's
fields. Surface DaemonConfigConflictError on the Settings save path.
---
